// A DECLARED struct whose only field is a CLOSURE (`T0 = {f: (i32) => {f: K0}}`) and the
// INLINE spelling of the same shape are twins. The list literal is written with the inline
// element annotation while the param takes `T0[]`. `structIndexOfObjCtx`'s ambiguity arm
// used to consult `structIndexOfTypeName(nodeTyName(objIx))` FIRST — a render-derived
